00:01:49.732 --> 00:01:51.916
- Look at that shit, look
at that, look at that!

00:01:51.916 --> 00:01:53.263
Oh fuck, it created a line.

00:01:53.263 --> 00:01:55.701
- Fold the skin over, ah!

00:01:57.931 --> 00:02:01.481
Um, yeah, so it,

00:02:01.481 --> 00:02:05.334
it stuck, but I look crazy.

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:06.298
- It's another version of me

00:02:06.298 --> 00:02:08.435
