a lot of people out there

00:03:38.263 --> 00:03:40.469
who don't share the opinion

00:03:40.469 --> 00:03:43.790
that you have to have a double
eyelid to look beautiful.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:46.538
(light orchestra music)

